<title>GERMANY: Saltus Technology shares 32-37 dmk in bookbuilding.</title>
<headline>Saltus Technology shares 32-37 dmk in bookbuilding.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Saltus Technology AG said on Tuesday that the bookbuilding price range for its soon-to-be-issued shares would be 32 to 37 marks ($21.11).</p>
<p>The company, which is to issue 800,000 shares as part of the German bourse's New Market for growth stocks, plans a listing on July 14.</p>
<p>The price will be fixed on July 12 and the subscription period runs from July 9 though July 11, Saltus said.</p>
<p>Saltus, an engineering firm, reported net profit of 2.2 million marks for the business year ended January 31 on sales of 14.7 million marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
<p>($ = 1.752 German Marks)</p>
